{
  "id": "ipr4_news_research",
  "name": "ipr4_news_research",
  "display_name": "ИПР-4: исследование новостей",
  "description": "Исследование загруженного архива: постановка, согласование, термины, поиск, критик, одно исправление и результат с источниками.",
  "execution_mode": "dynamic",
  "max_iterations": 50,
  "run_timeout_seconds": 14400,
  "is_default": false,
  "prompts": [{"name":"Цифровая оптимизация разработки и добычи","text":"По загруженному архиву найди технологии цифровой оптимизации разработки и добычи. Покажи задачи, методы, описанные применения и источники; исключи документооборот и переработку. Используй весь фактический период выбранного архива."}],
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"start","type":"start"},
    {"id":"news_requirements","type":"phase","phase_label":"requirements","label":"Постановка исследования","task_type":"ipr4_news_requirements","description":"Проверь доставленный архив и его даты. Сохрани версию постановки prepare_brief; на уточнении пересмотри текущую версию по реальному сообщению пользователя. Полный поиск до согласования запрещён.","agent_selection":"direct","agent_type":"ipr4_news_requirements","reads":["user_prompt","conversation_history","project_attachments","requirements"],"writes":["requirements"],"max_retries":0},
    {"id":"news_brief_ready","type":"validator","checks":[{"kind":"json_schema","key":"requirements","json_schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","brief","reference"],"properties":{"status":{"const":"ok"},"brief":{"type":"object"},"reference":{"type":"object","required":["path","sha256"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}}}}}}]},
    {"id":"approve_news_brief","type":"approval_gate","label":"Согласование постановки исследования","show_keys":["requirements"]},
    {"id":"approved_news_brief_ready","type":"validator","checks":[{"kind":"json_schema","key":"requirements","json_schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","brief","reference"],"properties":{"status":{"const":"ok"},"brief":{"type":"object"},"reference":{"type":"object","required":["path","sha256"]}}}}]},
    {"id":"news_terminology","type":"phase","phase_label":"planning","label":"Термины и доступность архива","task_type":"ipr4_news_terminology","description":"После согласования выполни короткую проверку read_manifest. Прочитай текущую постановку и B03, сохрани понятия, разрешённые расширения, исключения и фактическое решение согласования.","agent_selection":"direct","agent_type":"ipr4_news_terminologist","reads":["requirements","workflow_approval","conversation_history"],"writes":["news_terms"],"max_retries":0},
    {"id":"news_terms_ready","type":"validator","checks":[{"kind":"json_schema","key":"news_terms","json_schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","terminology_result","approval"],"properties":{"status":{"const":"ok"},"terminology_result":{"type":"object"},"approval":{"type":"object"}}}}]},
    {"id":"news_research","type":"phase","phase_label":"execution","label":"Поиск и решения по источникам","task_type":"ipr4_news_research","description":"Вызови candidates для согласованной версии. По доступным полным текстам запиши черновик включений, исключений, подтверждений и событий для независимого критика. Финализацию пока не выполняй.","agent_selection":"direct","agent_type":"ipr4_news_researcher","reads":["requirements","news_terms","conversation_history"],"writes":["news_draft"],"max_retries":0},
    {"id":"news_draft_ready","type":"validator","checks":[{"kind":"json_schema","key":"news_draft","json_schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","candidates_path","draft_path"],"properties":{"status":{"const":"ok"},"candidates_path":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"draft_path":{"type":"string","minLength":1}}}}]},
    {"id":"news_critic","type":"phase","phase_label":"qa","label":"Проверка критиком","task_type":"ipr4_news_critic","description":"Независимо проверь включённые и исключённые сюжеты, исходные фрагменты, уровень подтверждения и группы событий. Запиши конкретные замечания по фактическим пограничным примерам.","agent_selection":"direct","agent_type":"ipr4_news_critic","reads":["requirements","news_terms","news_draft"],"writes":["news_critique"],"max_retries":0},
    {"id":"news_critique_ready","type":"validator","checks":[{"kind":"json_schema","key":"news_critique","json_schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","review_path","findings"],"properties":{"status":{"const":"ok"},"review_path":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"findings":{"type":"array"}}}}]},
    {"id":"news_correction","type":"phase","phase_label":"execution","label":"Одно исправление и расчёт","task_type":"ipr4_news_correction","description":"Один раз внеси обоснованные исправления по замечаниям критика, сохрани неопределённости и вызови finalize для расчёта news-result.json. При отсутствии замечаний сохрани исходные решения. Зарегистрируй фактический JSON через create.","agent_selection":"direct","agent_type":"ipr4_news_corrector","reads":["requirements","news_terms","news_draft","news_critique","conversation_history"],"writes":["news_result"],"max_retries":0},
    {"id":"news_result_ready","type":"validator","checks":[{"kind":"json_schema","key":"news_result","json_schema":{"type":"object","required":["status","result"],"properties":{"status":{"const":"ok"},"result":{"type":"object","minProperties":1}}}}]},
    {"id":"news_summary","type":"phase","phase_label":"output","label":"Результат исследования","task_type":"ipr4_news_summary","description":"По сохранённому news-result.json объясни в Chat рассчитанные количества публикаций и событий, примеры с источниками, исправления критика и ограничения. Не обещай ещё не созданные экспорты.","agent_selection":"direct","agent_type":"ipr4_news_summary","reads":["requirements","news_result","news_critique"],"writes":["news_summary"],"max_retries":0},
    {"id":"end","type":"end"}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"from":"start","to":"news_requirements"},
    {"from":"news_requirements","to":"news_brief_ready"},
    {"from":"news_brief_ready","to":"approve_news_brief","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"approve_news_brief","to":"approved_news_brief_ready","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"approved_news_brief_ready","to":"news_terminology","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"approve_news_brief","to":"news_requirements","condition":"rejected"},
    {"from":"news_terminology","to":"news_terms_ready"},
    {"from":"news_terms_ready","to":"news_research","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"news_research","to":"news_draft_ready"},
    {"from":"news_draft_ready","to":"news_critic","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"news_critic","to":"news_critique_ready"},
    {"from":"news_critique_ready","to":"news_correction","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"news_correction","to":"news_result_ready"},
    {"from":"news_result_ready","to":"news_summary","condition":"approved"},
    {"from":"news_summary","to":"end"}
  ]
}
